WEBVTT

00:06:58.706 --> 00:07:03.294
with an array of toys and items
for the kinky community to play with,

00:07:03.294 --> 00:07:04.753
if they so please.

00:07:05.254 --> 00:07:06.714
It's like a playground.

00:07:07.339 --> 00:07:08.507
For adults.

00:07:08.507 --> 00:07:09.675
(Laughter)

00:07:10.342 --> 00:07:14.430
In BDSM, everything is negotiated
before it happens.

00:07:15.055 --> 00:07:17.266
And these are some
of the rules and regulations

00:07:17.308 --> 00:07:19.435
that would greet you upon entry.

00:07:20.311 --> 00:07:21.645
One:

00:07:21.687 --> 00:07:24.648
Do not touch anyone without asking.

00:07:25.024 --> 00:07:26.192
Even a hug,

00:07:26.192 --> 00:07:29.153
if you don't know somebody,
is a bad move without permission.